@camera K12
@mark kirru_child platform_edge_child walk
@wait 2.0
Kirru_child as "Kirru child" [neutral]: You came back. Did you find out how to stop? #line:ch18_child_001
<<if $ch10_asha_answered_child>>
    Asha [neutral]: I think so. It's going to cost a lot. #line:ch18_child_002
<<else>>
