<<endif>>
Kirru_child as "Kirru child" [neutral]: Will you turn around, when it's yours? #line:ch18_child_004
@wait 3.0
Asha [tender]: I hope someone will turn around for me. #line:ch18_child_005
@wait 2.0
<<set $ch18_child_answered = true>>
